{"metaDescription":"","name":"business-shipment","metaTitle":"business-shipment","mobile":"","content":"<h1 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: BPGMrgvlovaniCaps2010Regular, sylfaen;\">Business Shipment</h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: BPGMrgvlovaniCaps2010Regular, sylfaen;\">\r\n<div class=\"region region-content\" style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<div id=\"block-system-main\" class=\"block block-system\">\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n<div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"field-items\">\r\n<div class=\"field-item even\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: BPGMrgvlovani2010Regular, sylfaen; line-height: 1.9em; text-align: justify;\">Gzavnili LLC operatis air freight services from any point in the US to any destination around a globe. We partnered with the worlds most reliable airlines to assure that your shipments are on time every time.&nbsp;We constantly researches and confirms to you the most cost effective and efficient way to move your cargo whether it is oversized, HAZMAT or fragile.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: BPGMrgvlovani2010Regular, sylfaen; line-height: 1.9em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, helvetica, arial; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-center;\">We are committed to providing the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: tahoma, helvetica, arial; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-center;\">best possible shipping experience</strong><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, helvetica, arial; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-center;\">, as well as the lowest discounted freight rates for all your shipping needs</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: BPGMrgvlovani2010Regular, sylfaen; line-height: 1.9em; text-align: justify;\">For more information Please contact us or request a quotation .&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: BPGMrgvlovani2010Regular, sylfaen; line-height: 1.9em; text-align: justify;\">To calculate valu